 differentia; <ab>oft.</ab> in <ab>comp.</ab> and translated by ‘special’, ‘peculiar’ <ab>&c.</ab>;
 {#viSezaM nADigacCAmo gAyato rAGavasya ca#} <ls>Rām. 7. 94. 14</ls>; {#pratyAdizwaviSezamaRqanaviDiH#} <ls>Ś. 6. 5</ls>.
