 {#tulayitumalaM yatra tEstErviSezEH#} <ls>Me. 66</ls>, <ls n="Me.">59</ls>.
.²8 Excellence, superiority, distinction; usually at the end of <ab>comp.</ab> and
 translated by ‘excellent’, ‘distinguished’, ‘pre-eminent’, ‘choice’, <ab>&c.</ab>;
 {#anuBAvaviSezAttu#} <ls>R. 1. 37</ls>; {#vapurviSezezu#} <ls>Ku. 5. 31</ls>; <ls>R. 2. 7</ls>, <ls n="R.">6. 5</ls>;
 <ls>Ki. 9. 58</ls>; so {#AkftiviSezAH#} ‘excellent forms’, {#atiTiviSezaH#}
 ‘a distinguished guest’ <ab>&c.</ab>
